  "title": "Grandma's Best Zucchini Bread",
  "description": "Grandma's zucchini bread recipe is enriched with chopped dates and has the flavor of cinnamon, nutmeg, and ginger in every bite!",
  "authors": [
    "Korrine"
  ],
